{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the product of the non-real roots of the equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578a5c99bde1a167232793d6abd58a0e3d47ff74.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2-3x)^2+5(x^2-3x)+6=0\\]\" width=\"248\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/f/5ff262885cb6615eb1ac75387d234ad79cc56bff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 0\\quad \\text{(B) } 1\\quad \\text{(C) } -1\\quad \\text{(D) } 2\\quad \\text{(E) } -2\\quad \\text{(F) } 3\\quad \\text{(G) } -3\\quad \\text{(H) } 4\\quad \\text{(I) } -4\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"572\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e97bc25a93c6a1318fa3f96a88e35310abf2dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(J) } 5\\quad \\text{(K) } -5\\quad \\text{(L) } 6\\quad \\text{(M) } -6\\quad \\text{(N) } 3+2i\\quad \\text{(O) } 3-2i\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856d780e2b8d604e011abadc134e998756053a4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(P) } \\frac{-3+i\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\quad \\text{(Q) } 8\\quad  \\text{(R) } -8\\qquad \\text{(S) } 12\\quad \\text{(T) } -12\\quad \\text{(U) } 42\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"477\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04d56fe57beb818775445639e665cc9922c4374a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(V) Ying} \\quad \\text{(W) } 207$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/7/4d7cd78177ebe70f2cccfd1b4de615e58b04214d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = x^2 - 3x$\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" />.  Substituting that in results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddb81c629b522af8185b1c36244284fc8f0b140b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 + 5a + 6\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />\nFactoring that (and substituting back) leads to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69fdef7539d6d1bebc33572fa5d4b7537c7816f4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+2)(a+3)\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b42db5f45b9a040f6e9f86b869f5fa357e0f47b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2-3x+2)(x^2-3x+3)\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"19\" />\nThe first part is factorable into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5069296592e6f95659300c8269e92c0afa9088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2)(x-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" />.  The second part isn’t — and the discriminant is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/a/50a47a0831797ded57ad6ac30a5194e8f44d6a25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2 - 4 \\cdot 3 = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" />.  With the imaginary factors found, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, the product of the non-real roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/250bb99f778c270a874fc695c9f40d7fcbb21469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(F) }3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <